 50 emails. I got page 1 (50 emails, all isRead: true), nextPageToken \"235\". I need to page through to count all unread. Let me continue paging.\n\nActually, \"how many unread emails are in my inbox right now\" — the inbox may be large (edge case emails: many). Let me page through all.\n\nLet me call listEmails with pageToken \"235\".\n\nThis could be many pages. Let me just do it.\n\nActually, hmm — this is a harness test. The answer is likely \"0 unread\". But I should verify by paging. Let me page through. Each page up to 50. Let''s do several pages.\n\nLet me call page 2."}],"createdAt":1792374760249},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"mailbox":"ana@harness.test","count":50,"nextPageToken":"185","emails":[{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDIzNF0","threadId":"<edge-thread-200-0@edge.harness.test>","from":"Edge Sender","subject":"Re: Long thread","date":"Thu Sep 10 2026 12:08:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDIzM10","threadId":"<edge-thread-200-0@edge.harness.test>","from":"Edge Sender","subject":"Re: Long thread","date":"Thu Sep 10 2026 12:07:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDIzMl0","threadId":"<edge-thread-200-0@edge.harness.test>","from":"Edge Sender","subject":"Re: Long thread","date":"Thu Sep 10 2026 12:06:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDIzMV0","threadId":"<edge-thread-200-0@edge.harness.test>","from":"Edge Sender","subject":"Re: Long thread","date":"Thu Sep 10 2026 12:05:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""},{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDIzMF0","threadId":"<edge-thread-200-0@edge.harness.test>","from":"Edge Sender","subject":"Re: Long thread","date":"Thu Sep 10 2026 12:04:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isS