ds like \"newsletter\", \"digest\", \"promotion\", or common newsletter senders might work.\n\nI will use `searchMail` with relevant keywords.\nThe last search was on a specific mailbox, but the user''s request is general (\"Find emails that look like newsletters or digests\"), so I should search across all mailboxes by default, which is the behavior of `searchMail` when no `mailboxId` is passed.\nI will use broad terms.The user asks to find emails that look like newsletters or digests. Let me search mail for \"newsletter\", \"digest\", \"weekly\", \"roundup\", \"bulletin\", \"update\".\n\nBut wait — the previous turn''s context: the user asked \"Did any order of mine ship recently?\" I found \"Your order A-42 has shipped\" from Acme Store in ana@harness.test. But I got distracted into paging the inbox... Actually the prior assistant turn seems to have been about a different question (unread count). Anyway.\n\nNow the current request: find newsletter/digest-looking emails. Let me search all mailboxes.\n\nLet me run parallel searches: \"newsletter\", \"digest\", \"weekly\", \"roundup\", \"bulletin\".\n\nAlso maybe listMailboxes to know mailboxes? searchMail searches every mailbox by default and tags source mailbox. Good.\n\nLet me do several searches in one block."}],"createdAt":1792374812366},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"count":1,"emails":[{"mailboxId":"4c045289-9c42-53f9-a3d7-2dfac727d3d0","mailbox":"ana@harness.test","id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDI4NF0","threadId":"<e2e-privacy-vectors-0001@harness.test>","from":"Shop Weekly","subject":"This week at the shop","date":"Sat Sep 26 2026 08:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","isRead":true,"isStarred":false,"snippet":""}]},"toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-804d492eff88a085","toolName":"searchMail","args":{"query":"newsletter"}},"updatedAt":1792374815775},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"count":0,"emails":[]},"toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-9