ng later, that drive is the first place to suspect.\n\nWant me to browse any of them, or search all seven for something specific?","createdAt":1792374920293}],"metadata":{"modelId":"deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:floor","provider":"openai-compatible.chat"},"content":"**7 drives** are connected to this workspace — all of them under **ana@harness.test**, none under another account.\n\n| # | driveId | Provider | Scope |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `c92b4299-1f7c-571a-ab7e-aa39d6c8bb32` | SFTP | Full drive |\n| 2 | `66e47377-dba1-5bfd-945e-a2e575ae1511` | FTP | Full drive |\n| 3 | `7966bf69-d3ed-5a47-9bd7-9a807d9a645d` | FTP | **Only selected folders** |\n| 4 | `6b8c0a7c-3d05-5f0c-b50c-e3da0da47f2b` | FTP | Full drive |\n| 5 | `1a17bf00-c9d1-5cdd-81d1-ce8b6583982c` | WebDAV | Full drive |\n| 6 | `4258fe0c-92ff-5c5b-85dd-797a798ab5c6` | S3 | Full drive |\n| 7 | `a8caddaf-15c9-57c2-a67e-93e7cffc3beb` | S3 | Full drive |\n\nTwo things worth knowing:\n\n- **Three of the seven are plain FTP** (drives 2, 3 and 4) — so most of your file storage here is FTP-based, plus one SFTP, one WebDAV and two S3 buckets. There''s no Google Drive or OneDrive in this workspace.\n- **Drive 3 is folder-scoped** (`7966bf69-…`): the workspace was granted only some of its folders, so anything outside those won''t appear when I browse or search it. The other six are visible end to end. If a file seems to be missing later, that drive is the first place to suspect.\n\nWant me to browse any of them, or search all seven for something specific?"}','assistant','v2','2026-10-19T01:54:58.901Z','7f765568-8c0d-56ce-8b89-105126fefedf');
