nding with \"Now I have the full inbox: 5 pages of 50 + 34 = 284 unread...\" — no wait, that text appears as part of my thinking? Let me look at the structure again.\n\nThe visible structure:\n1. system prompt\n2. user turn (find newsletters)\n3. assistant: searchMail batch → results\n4. assistant message with long thinking-ish text and then... hmm, actually there''s a block: \"Now I have the full inbox: 5 pages of 50 + 34 = 284 unread... wait, let me recount...\" That''s inside the assistant''s visible text? It appears in the transcript as part of the assistant turn''s text before the tool call block. Hmm — it looks like my own reasoning got emitted. Whatever.\n\nKey: the earlier turns'' details (read-later 1, snoozed 0, scheduled moodboard) I \"remember\" from... Actually in the visible text there''s mention: \"Let''s assume I have access to browse/search...\" Hmm.\n\nOK. Rather than agonize, the safest approach: base the status update on solid facts I can cite:\n- Inbox ana@harness.test: ~284 unread, overwhelmingly automated edge-case test mail from \"Edge Sender\" (Sep 10), plus a handful of real items.\n- Real/notable items: Raj Mehta \"Rebrand kickoff\" (Sep 21) + \"Rebrand review\" invite for Thu Oct 8 (already past), Acme Store \"Your order A-42 has shipped\" (Sep 23), Harness Bank debit INR 1,250 (Sep 25), GitHub sign-in code (Sep 22), Shop Weekly newsletter (Sep 26).\n- Calendar this week (Oct 19–25): Daily standup on Work calendar at 09:00–09:15 UTC each weekday (Mon–Fri), plus \"Daily forever\" on \"Edge cases\" calendar daily; a \"Ten year all-day event\" spanning 2026–2036 on Edge cases.\n\nWait — \"Daily standup\" only appears Mon Oct 19 – Fri Oct 23 (5 occurrences), and \"Daily forever\" appears Oct 19–25 (7). So standups Mon–Fri.\n\nSo the to-do list likely: (1) triage/clean the ~284-email edge-case backlog; (2) follow up on rebrand (kickoff thread + review meeting); (3) order A-42 tracking; (4) bank debit note; (5) daily standups.\n\nShould I verif